          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "John Parker has submitted a patch that fixes this issue by causing the connection to be released if the result count is 1 and the ResultSet is on the last row (previously, it only closed it if the resultset was ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "strong"
           }
          ],
          "text": "after",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " the last row).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The patch is attached.  After testing, it is scheduled to go into Fedora 3.0 and maintenance-2.2.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "File Added: FieldSearchResultSQLImpl_20071212_jap54-cornell.edu.patch",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
