     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: cwilper<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=189298<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n<p>John Parker has submitted a patch that fixes this issue by causing the connection to be released if the result count is 1 and the ResultSet is on the last row (previously, it only closed it if the resultset was <b>after</b> the last row).</p>\n\n<p>The patch is attached.  After testing, it is scheduled to go into Fedora 3.0 and maintenance-2.2.<br/>\nFile Added: FieldSearchResultSQLImpl_20071212_jap54-cornell.edu.patch</p>",
